# --- Azure, non-Compute product families (UBI-175 config-expansion phase) ---
#
# Same real openapi schema_source as [dynamic_providers.azure] above, one
# entry per real, distinct ARM spec FILE -- unlike GCP's Discovery Docs (one
# merged document per product), Azure's azure-rest-api-specs splits most real
# resource providers across many parallel per-domain files within the same
# stable version folder (e.g. Microsoft.Sql/SQL/stable/2025-01-01/ alone has
# 142 real files: databases.json, servers.json, jobs.json, ... -- confirmed
# live, not a single merged RP document the way Compute's own ComputeRP.json
# is). Each schema_url/path/version pulled directly from a real, live
# raw.githubusercontent.com fetch of azure-rest-api-specs' own current main
# branch, always the latest real "stable" (never "preview") version folder,
# with any sibling "Legacy"-named folder deliberately excluded (a real bug
# caught live in this same session: Microsoft.Sql's own "Legacy" branch has
# a real stable/2014-04-01-legacy/ with only 4 stub files, which an earlier,
# less careful traversal silently preferred over the real, current, 142-file
# SQL/stable/2025-01-01/ branch -- caught before being written here, not
# after). base_url is the same real, single ARM control-plane endpoint every
# entry in this block shares -- honest, since none of these ever executes a
# real call against it (see the naming caveat below); no auth block is
# declared per entry because codegen only ever calls Schema() against a
# public GitHub raw URL, never Configure/ReadResource (matching Kubernetes'
# own entry's identical real, honestly-scoped reasoning above).
#
# NAMING CAVEAT, same as the google_<api> block above: cli/sdk.go's
# generateOneDynamicProvider uses a [dynamic_providers.<name>] table's own key
# directly as the generated output's claimed manifest repo identity
# (github.com/ubiquex/ubx-sdk-<name>). None of these azure_<rp>_<file> entries
# has a real per-file repo -- there is no real, published, non-Compute Azure
# ARM bindings repo at all today. These entries exist ONLY for real
# schema-fetch / `ubx sdk gen --dump-ir` resource-and-field counting to support
# this session's docs-artifact work; never run a real publish/write step
# against one expecting a real target repo to exist.

