# [dynamic_provider_groups.azure_all]: every real Azure ARM spec entry
# above (the original azure/compute entry plus all 301 azure_<domain>
# entries), merged into the single, real, published github.com/ubiquex/
# ubx-sdk-azure identity -- same real multi-source-into-one-repo
# mechanism (cli/sdk.go's generateDynamicProviderGroup) already used for
# [dynamic_provider_groups.google_all] above. Keyed "azure_all", not
# "azure", for the identical real reason the GCP group is keyed
# "google_all" not "google": a group named identically to one of its
# own members makes --only match both in the same run, writing to the
# same output path from two different code paths (a real bug this
# pipeline caught live on its first run against the GCP config).
# repo_name = "azure" carries the real published repo identity
# separately from the table's own --only match key.
#
# This group replaces the azurerm_* identity ubx-sdk-azure was
# generated from before -- azurerm_* (hashicorp/azurerm) and azure_*
# (this real ARM corpus) are a permanent, structural namespace split,
# not staleness (verified zero real overlap by type name): publishing
# more azurerm_* content would never help the current azure_* corpus.
